  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The knife in the dark and the marksman who ends a fight before it starts. You study the target, choose the ground, strike the one exposed moment, then are gone before the counterattack. On a run you are the legwork and recon specialist; in a fight you are the precision striker and skirmisher who deals disproportionate damage to Marked or unaware foes while staying mobile.</p><p>Your engine is <strong>Advantage</strong>: banked positional and informational leverage - being one step ahead, spent to make decisive action. The loop is <strong>Mark, strike from advantage, bank more advantage</strong>. You are the Operator's clean counterpart: fully mundane, casting nothing, edge earned from skill, Kit doctrine, and chrome.</p><h3>The Advantage Engine</h3><ul><li><strong>First blood / surprise:</strong> at encounter start gain Advantage equal to your Victories; +1 more if you begin hidden or with surprise.</li><li><strong>Steady read (+1/turn):</strong> gain 1 Advantage at the start of each of your turns.</li><li><strong>Exploit the Mark (+1):</strong> the first time each round you damage a Marked target - or any target unaware of you / that you are hidden from.</li><li><strong>Reposition (+1):</strong> the first time each round you end a Hide/Disengage/shift and then strike (fade-and-strike).</li></ul><p><strong>Cap by Hero Tier (T5 to T1): 8 / 11 / 14 / 18 / 22.</strong> Unspent Advantage is lost at the end of the encounter. Signatures cost no Advantage; heroics spend it. <em>House discount:</em> a Power-Roll heroic costs 1 less Advantage when made with an edge or double edge. Advantage is class power and never bought or fed by nuyen or Body Integrity.</p><h3>Advancement (internal Level 1-5 = player-facing Tier 5-1)</h3><p>At <strong>Tier 5</strong> (start) you choose your Method subclass, your three signatures, and your first heroic ability. Every Tier after, you pick a new Advantage ability, your cap rises, and your characteristics sharpen. The ladder caps at <strong>Tier 1</strong>.</p>",
      "director": ""
    },
